	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'　　　Helman'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'　　　Planned City Cossack'
	\L_00f84:
	ZH 1:
	'Helman 4th Army HQ'
	R
	R
	'　　　　　Command Room'
	\L_00f84:
	ZH 1:
	'The general, Nero, received a'
	R
	'report of the Leazas Army’s'
	R
	'advance.'
	\L_00f84:
	\L_00f77:
	\L_00e5f:
	ZH 1:
	'Finally here, are they...?'
	R
	'Damned Leazas...'
	\L_00f84:
	ZH 1:
	'Alright, intercept them at once.'
	R
	'Of course, our opponent is'
	R
	'Leazas... A talentless bunch.'
	\L_00f84:
	ZH 1:
	'Rout them all at once.'
	\L_00f84:
	\L_00f77:
	\L_00ecf:
	ZH 1:
	'Excuse me.'
	\L_00f84:
	\L_00f77:
	\L_00f31:
	!VAR0516 : 26!
	\L_00f23:
	\L_00f07:
	ZH 1:
	'The glasses-wearing lieutenant'
	R
	'general, Cream Ganoblade,'
	R
	'appeared.'
	\L_00f84:
	\L_00f77:
	\L_00ecf:
	ZH 1:
	'General Nero, I have a plan here'
	R
	'to most effectively use our'
	R
	'location to intercept them.'
	\L_00f84:
	ZH 1:
	'If you could read it...'
	\L_00f84:
	\L_00f77:
	\L_00e5f:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_00f84:
	\L_00f77:
	\L_00e97:
	ZH 1:
	'Nero brushed away the bunch of'
	R
	'documents Cream presented to'
	R
	'him without giving them a look.'
	\L_00f84:
	ZH 1:
	'　　＜swoosh）'
	\L_00f84:
	ZH 1:
	'The plan Cream had prepared'
	R
	'fluttered through the air and'
	R
	'fell to the floor.'
	\L_00f84:
	\L_00f77:
	\L_00ecf:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_00f84:
	\L_00f77:
	\L_00e5f:
	ZH 1:
	'Cream Ganoblade.'
	R
	'Your strategies are always,'
	R
	'always underhanded.'
	\L_00f84:
	ZH 1:
	'A knight should fight fair.'
	\L_00f84:
	ZH 1:
	'Even if you win fighting like'
	R
	'this, Empress Sheila will not be'
	R
	'pleased.'
	\L_00f84:
	\L_00f77:
	\L_00ecf:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_00f84:
	\L_00f77:
	\L_00eeb:
	ZH 1:
	'...He doesn’t understand...'
	\L_00f84:
	ZH 1:
	'Battles are decided by'
	R
	'strategies made before even'
	R
	'arriving at the battlefield...'
	\L_00f84:
	\L_00f77:
	\L_00e5f:
	ZH 1:
	'Anyway, give the order to'
	R
	'depart at once.'
	\L_00f84:
	\L_00f77:
	\L_00ecf:
	ZH 1:
	'...Understood.'
	\L_00f84:
	\L_00f77:
	\L_00eeb:
	ZH 1:
	'Why did I have to be put under'
	R
	'him?'
	\L_00f84:
	ZH 1:
	'If nothing changes, everyone'
	R
	'working for him will go to'
	R
	'waste.'
	\L_00f84:
	\L_00f77:
	\L_00e5f:
	ZH 1:
	'What are you standing around'
	R
	'for? Can’t you even give an'
	R
	'order quickly?!'
	\L_00f84:
	\L_00f77:
	\L_00ecf:
	ZH 1:
	'...Excuse me.'
	\L_00f84:
	\L_00f77:
	\L_00f31:
	\L_00e5f:
	ZH 1:
	'Good god... It’s because nobody'
	R
	'listens to me quickly enough'
	R
	'that I get poor results...'
	\L_00f84:
	\L_00f77:
	\L_00e97:
	ZH 1:
	'Nero spat out those words'
	R
	'while he refined his'
	R
	'chivalrous, just plan.'
	\L_00f84:
