		\L_00eb3:
		\L_00e97:
		ZH 1:
		'Cream was sitting in front of'
		R
		'the general’s desk, staring'
		R
		'closely at a map.'
		\L_00f84:
		ZH 1:
		'Cream had, as the lieutenant'
		R
		'general,'
		\L_00f84:
		ZH 1:
		'inherited General Nero’s'
		R
		'position after he was gone.'
		\L_00f84:
		\L_00f77:
		\L_00e7b:
		ZH 1:
		'It finally happened.'
		\L_00f84:
		ZH 1:
		'We’ve lost a considerable number'
		R
		'of our troops, but the fight'
		R
		'isn’t over yet...'
		\L_00f84:
		ZH 1:
		'I’ll show them I can turn this'
		R
		'around somehow with my'
		R
		'strategies.'
		\L_00f84:
		ZH 1:
		'I won’t use such single-minded,'
		\L_00f84:
		ZH 1:
		'thoughtless plans where we just'
		R
		'charge and get killed over and'
		R
		'over like Nero...'
		\L_00f84:
		ZH 1:
		'I’ll win more naturally, by'
		R
		'using our people, minimizing'
		R
		'casualties,'
		\L_00f84:
		ZH 1:
		'and finding victory and profit'
		R
		'for Helman.'
		\L_00f84:
		ZH 1:
		'The day where I realize the'
		R
		'strategies Nero stomped all over'
		R
		'has come... I’m so glad...'
		\L_00f84:
		ZH 1:
		'I’ll do my best.'
		\L_00f84:
		ZH 1:
		'Yes... Even women can do it when'
		R
		'they get to... But not like'
		R
		'General Mineva... My own way...'
		\L_00f84:
		\L_00f77:
		\L_00e97:
		ZH 1:
		'While it was only temporary,'
		R
		'Nero’s death gave Cream full'
		R
		'control of the 4th Army.'
		\L_00f84:
		ZH 1:
		'She was brimming with'
		R
		'motivation.'
